00:01:50.811 --> 00:01:53.847 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JEAN-DENIS CHAREST, président

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.948 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Chambre de commerce, est de Mtl

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:56.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
